  "bio": "Govina Taylor is a highly skilled tattoo artist based in Fayetteville, United States, best known for her distinct illustrative tattoo style that captivates both the eye and the imagination. Her work is infused with a sense of mystique and artistry, a reflection of her unique birth during a full solar eclipse. Clients and art enthusiasts can support and purchase her intriguing creations at @portolumenstudios on Etsy.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Fayetteville, North Carolina, United States\n\nShe was born in the middle of a full solar eclipse like some unfortunate omen. Follow and buy her art @portolumenstudios on Etsy",
